{"The second OR branch in the deleteMany query deletes ANY WorkflowReminder with retryCount > 1 regardless of method type, because it lacks a method: WorkflowMethods.SMS filter, causing non-SMS reminders (EMAIL, WHATSAPP) to be unintentionally deleted by the SMS cron job": 0.992546021938324, "In scheduleSMSReminders, the catch block calls prisma.workflowReminder.update() to increment retryCount, but that update can throw if the reminder was deleted concurrently, escaping the catch and aborting the entire cron run": 0.8453379273414612}